      "abstractions": [
        "Two send attempts and three text classes (\"A\", \"B\" and \"both\" for restored text followed by newer typing).",
        "The transport is called, refuses before dispatch, or accepts; what the agent received is a hidden fact revealed only when the transport settles. The 5-second settle bound is a nondeterministic timeout.",
        "Callers that pass an explicit argument require an empty composer; that precondition is a guard of the send action.",
        "A session change is not interleaved with the connect wait of a new send. Message edit and resend, navigation delivery and the stopped-reply notice are outside this model.",
        "The typing indicator is cleared only by the attempt that still owns the send, and an explicit-argument send is not compared with the composer text."
      ]
    },
